./manual/CHANGESLOG.md:3059:Fix: both `pakettiSlicesToPhrase()` and `pakettiSlicesToPhrasesPerSlice()` now read each slice's individual `base_note` from `instrument.sample_mappings[1][i+1]` (where `[1]` is the original sample and `[i+1]` is slice *i*). Each slice note in the phrase gets its own correct pitch value instead of a single shared one.
